[{"type":"pick","sentence":"The fox sleeps.","zh":"狐狸睡着了。","target":"fox","answer":"名词 n.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"fox 给一种动物起名字，在这里是名词。","icon":"fox","id":"c1-m1-q1","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m1","pages":"1–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Birds fly.","zh":"鸟儿飞翔。","target":"fly","answer":"动词 v.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"fly 告诉我们鸟儿在做什么，是动词。","icon":"bird","id":"c1-m1-q2","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m1","pages":"1–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The red apple is here.","zh":"红苹果在这里。","target":"red","answer":"形容词 adj.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"red 描述苹果是什么颜色，修饰名词 apple，是形容词。","icon":"apple","id":"c1-m1-q3","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m1","pages":"1–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The rabbit runs quickly.","zh":"兔子跑得很快。","target":"quickly","answer":"副词 adv.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"quickly 告诉我们“跑得怎样”，修饰 runs，是副词。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c1-m1-q4","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m1","pages":"1–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Hope is important.","zh":"希望很重要。","target":"Hope","answer":"名词 n.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"希望虽然看不见，也可以有名字。hope 在这里是抽象名词。","icon":"star","id":"c1-m1-q5","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m1","pages":"1–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The fox is happy.","zh":"狐狸很开心。","target":"is","answer":"动词 v.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"动词不只表示动作。is 是 be 动词，这里连接狐狸与开心的状态。","icon":"fox","id":"c1-m1-q6","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m1","pages":"1–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The small bird sings.","zh":"小鸟在唱歌。","target":"small","answer":"bird","options":["bird","sings"],"why":"small 说的是鸟的大小，形容词在这里修饰名词 bird。","icon":"bird","id":"c1-m2-q1","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m2","pages":"5–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The bird sings softly.","zh":"鸟儿轻轻地唱歌。","target":"softly","answer":"sings","options":["bird","sings"],"why":"softly 描述唱歌的方式，修饰动词 sings。","icon":"bird","id":"c1-m2-q2","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m2","pages":"5–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The soup is very hot.","zh":"汤很烫。","target":"very","answer":"hot","options":["soup","hot"],"why":"副词 very 也能修饰形容词，这里表示 hot 的程度。","icon":"bowl","id":"c1-m2-q3","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m2","pages":"5–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The turtle walks slowly.","zh":"乌龟走得慢。","target":"slowly","answer":"walks","options":["turtle","walks"],"why":"slowly 告诉我们走的速度，修饰 walks；不是说乌龟的颜色或大小。","icon":"turtle","id":"c1-m2-q4","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m2","pages":"5–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The bright moon shines.","zh":"明亮的月亮发着光。","target":"bright","answer":"moon","options":["moon","shines"],"why":"bright 描述月亮，修饰名词 moon，是形容词。","icon":"moon","id":"c1-m2-q5","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m2","pages":"5–6"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"We play in the park.","zh":"我们在公园里玩。","target":"play","answer":"动词 v.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"这里 play 表示“玩”这个动作，是动词。","icon":"ball","id":"c1-m3-q1","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m3","pages":"1–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The play is funny.","zh":"这部戏剧很有趣。","target":"play","answer":"名词 n.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"这里 play 是“戏剧”的名字，是名词。同一个拼写可以做不同工作。","icon":"house","id":"c1-m3-q2","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m3","pages":"1–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I drink water.","zh":"我喝水。","target":"water","answer":"名词 n.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"这里 water 是喝的东西“水”，是名词。","icon":"water","id":"c1-m3-q3","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m3","pages":"1–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I water the flowers.","zh":"我给花浇水。","target":"water","answer":"动词 v.","options":["名词 n.","动词 v.","形容词 adj.","副词 adv."],"why":"这里 water 表示“浇水”的动作，是动词。","icon":"flower","id":"c1-m3-q4","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m3","pages":"1–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I have a book.","zh":"我有一本书。","target":"book","answer":"名词 n.","options":["名词 n.","代词 pron.","冠词 art."],"why":"book 给物品起名字。I 才是代词，a 是冠词；不必把所有词都塞进四大词性。","icon":"book","id":"c1-m3-q5","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m3","pages":"1–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"We learn what words do.","zh":"我们学习词语的工作。","target":"三个核心问题","answer":"认识词性、学习用法、认识有相似功能的结构","options":["认识词性、学习用法、认识有相似功能的结构","只记住每个词的中文意思"],"why":"词意和词性一起学，再认识短语和从句如何做相似的工作。这就是贯穿全书的路线。","icon":"post","id":"c1-m3-q6","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m3","pages":"1–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Birds fly.","zh":"鸟儿飞翔。","target":"fly","answer":"这里不带直接宾语","options":["这里不带直接宾语","这里带直接宾语","这里连接主体与状态"],"why":"本句 fly 是不及物用法。Birds 是主语；句子没有飞的直接对象。","icon":"bird","id":"c1-m4-q1","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m4","pages":"4–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia opens the box.","zh":"米娅打开盒子。","target":"opens","answer":"这里带直接宾语","options":["这里不带直接宾语","这里带直接宾语","这里连接主体与状态"],"why":"打开的对象是 the box。opens 在本句是及物用法。","icon":"box","id":"c1-m4-q2","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m4","pages":"4–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia feels happy.","zh":"米娅觉得开心。","target":"feels","answer":"这里连接主体与状态","options":["这里不带直接宾语","这里带直接宾语","这里连接主体与状态"],"why":"happy 描述 Mia 的状态。feels 在这里是系动词，不是说米娅触摸一个东西。","icon":"fox","id":"c1-m4-q3","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m4","pages":"4–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I smell the flower.","zh":"我闻这朵花。","target":"smell","answer":"这里带直接宾语","options":["这里带直接宾语","这里连接主体与状态"],"why":"这里是我主动闻花，the flower 是对象。下句 The flower smells nice. 才是在描述花闻起来怎么样。","icon":"flower","id":"c1-m4-q4","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m4","pages":"4–5"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The flower smells nice.","zh":"花闻起来很香。","target":"smells","answer":"这里连接主体与状态","options":["这里带直接宾语","这里连接主体与状态"],"why":"nice 描述花的气味。smells 在这里连接花和描述；要看本次用法。","icon":"flower","id":"c1-m4-q5","chapter":"c1","mission":"c1-m4","pages":"4–5"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia opens the box.","zh":"找到主语：这句话在说谁？","parts":["Mia","opens","the box"],"answer":"Mia","why":"Mia 是谈论的主体，整个名词短语 the box 是动作的对象。","icon":"fox","id":"c2-m1-q1","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m1","pages":"7–8"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia opens the box.","zh":"找到谓语动词：发生什么？","parts":["Mia","opens","the box"],"answer":"opens","why":"opens 是“打开”，是本句谓语动词。","icon":"box","id":"c2-m1-q2","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m1","pages":"7–8"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia opens the box.","zh":"找到宾语：打开什么？","parts":["Mia","opens","the box"],"answer":"the box","why":"打开的是盒子，所以 the box 是宾语；包括 the 在内一起看。","icon":"box","id":"c2-m1-q3","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m1","pages":"7–8"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The little bird sings.","zh":"找到完整的主语词块。","parts":["The little bird","sings"],"answer":"The little bird","why":"谈论的是这只小鸟。主语可以是一组词，不只一个单词。","icon":"bird","id":"c2-m1-q4","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m1","pages":"7–8"},{"type":"role","sentence":"I like apples.","zh":"找到宾语：喜欢什么？","parts":["I","like","apples"],"answer":"apples","why":"喜欢的对象是 apples。I 是代词，在本句作主语。","icon":"apple","id":"c2-m1-q5","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m1","pages":"7–8"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The little bird sings softly.","zh":"哪一个词作定语，描述鸟的大小？","parts":["little","bird","sings","softly"],"answer":"little","why":"little 是形容词，在本句作定语，描述 bird。","icon":"bird","id":"c2-m2-q1","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m2","pages":"8–9"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The little bird sings softly.","zh":"哪一个词作状语，描述唱歌的方式？","parts":["little","bird","sings","softly"],"answer":"softly","why":"softly 是副词，在本句作状语，修饰 sings。","icon":"bird","id":"c2-m2-q2","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m2","pages":"8–9"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia reads in the garden.","zh":"哪一组词作状语，说明阅读地点？","parts":["Mia","reads","in the garden"],"answer":"in the garden","why":"介词短语 in the garden 整体作地点状语。状语不一定只是一个副词。","icon":"flower","id":"c2-m2-q3","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m2","pages":"8–9"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The fox in the hat smiles.","zh":"哪组词作定语，帮助认出是哪只狐狸？","parts":["The fox","in the hat","smiles"],"answer":"in the hat","why":"in the hat 修饰 fox，作后置定语。定语也不一定是形容词。","icon":"fox","id":"c2-m2-q4","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m2","pages":"8–9"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The rabbit runs quickly.","zh":"兔子跑得很快。","target":"quickly","answer":"副词是词性，状语是这里的句子成分","options":["副词是词性，状语是这里的句子成分","副词和状语是完全相同的分类"],"why":"“副词”说它属于哪种词；“状语”说它在句子中的功能。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c2-m2-q5","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m2","pages":"8–9"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is happy.","zh":"米娅很开心。","target":"happy","answer":"表语：说明主语 Mia","options":["表语：说明主语 Mia","宾补：说明宾语"],"why":"happy 接在系动词 is 后，说明主语 Mia 的状态，所以是表语。","icon":"mirror","id":"c2-m3-q1","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m3","pages":"9–16"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The story makes Mia happy.","zh":"这个故事让米娅开心。","target":"happy","answer":"宾补：说明宾语 Mia","options":["表语：说明主语 The story","宾补：说明宾语 Mia"],"why":"开心的是 Mia，故事使她开心。happy 说明宾语 Mia 的状态，是宾语补足语。","icon":"book","id":"c2-m3-q2","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m3","pages":"9–16"},{"type":"role","sentence":"We call the cat Coco.","zh":"哪个词是宾语补足语，说明猫的名字？","parts":["We","call","the cat","Coco"],"answer":"Coco","why":"the cat 是宾语；Coco 说明我们怎样称呼这只猫。猫与 Coco 指同一对象。","icon":"cat","id":"c2-m3-q3","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m3","pages":"9–16"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The soup tastes nice.","zh":"哪个词是表语，说明汤怎么样？","parts":["The soup","tastes","nice"],"answer":"nice","why":"tastes 是本句系动词；nice 说明主语 the soup 的味道。","icon":"bowl","id":"c2-m3-q4","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m3","pages":"9–16"},{"type":"role","sentence":"I see the bird flying.","zh":"哪个词块作宾语补足语，说明鸟在做什么？","parts":["I","see","the bird","flying"],"answer":"flying","why":"flying 补充说明宾语 the bird 正在飞。补足语也可以是分词结构，后续章再深入。","icon":"bird","id":"c2-m3-q5","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m3","pages":"9–16"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The red fox runs slowly.","zh":"红狐狸慢慢地跑。","target":"red","answer":"定语","options":["主语","定语","状语","表语"],"why":"red 描述 fox，是定语；The red fox 整体才是主语。","icon":"fox","id":"c2-m4-q1","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m4","pages":"7–17"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The red fox runs slowly.","zh":"红狐狸慢慢地跑。","target":"slowly","answer":"状语","options":["谓语动词","宾语","状语","宾补"],"why":"slowly 补充跑的方式，是状语；runs 才是谓语动词。","icon":"fox","id":"c2-m4-q2","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m4","pages":"7–17"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia becomes a teacher.","zh":"米娅成为一名老师。","target":"a teacher","answer":"表语","options":["宾语","表语","状语"],"why":"a teacher 说明 Mia 的身份，becomes 是系动词。后面有名词不一定是宾语。","icon":"house","id":"c2-m4-q3","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m4","pages":"7–17"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia gives Coco a ball.","zh":"米娅给可可一个球。","target":"a ball","answer":"直接宾语","options":["直接宾语","宾语补足语"],"why":"球是给的东西，不是在描述 Coco 是一个球。它是直接宾语；Coco 是接收者。","icon":"ball","id":"c2-m4-q4","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m4","pages":"7–17"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"We paint the door green.","zh":"我们把门漆成绿色。","target":"green","answer":"宾语补足语","options":["直接宾语","宾语补足语"],"why":"绿色描述门漆好后的状态。green 是宾补；门不是礼物的接收者。","icon":"door","id":"c2-m4-q5","chapter":"c2","mission":"c2-m4","pages":"7–17"},{"type":"build","words":["Birds","sing"],"sentence":"Birds sing.","zh":"鸟儿唱歌。","roles":["主语 S","谓语 V"],"why":"Birds 是主语，sing 是不及物用法，SV 骨架已经完整。","pattern":"S + V","icon":"house","id":"c3-m1-q1","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m1","pages":"18–21"},{"type":"build","words":["Mia","likes","apples"],"sentence":"Mia likes apples.","zh":"米娅喜欢苹果。","roles":["主语 S","谓语 V","宾语 O"],"why":"likes 的对象是 apples：谁＋喜欢＋什么，SVO。","pattern":"S + V + O","icon":"house","id":"c3-m1-q2","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m1","pages":"18–21"},{"type":"build","words":["The fox","is","happy"],"sentence":"The fox is happy.","zh":"狐狸很开心。","roles":["主语 S","系动词 V","表语 P"],"why":"happy 说明狐狸的状态，is 把它们连接起来，是 SVP。","pattern":"S + V + P","icon":"house","id":"c3-m1-q3","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m1","pages":"18–21"},{"type":"build","words":["Mia","gives","Coco","a ball"],"sentence":"Mia gives Coco a ball.","zh":"米娅给可可一个球。","roles":["主语 S","谓语 V","间接宾语 O","直接宾语 O"],"why":"给谁？Coco。给什么？a ball。两个宾语，是 SVOO。","pattern":"S + V + O + O","icon":"house","id":"c3-m1-q4","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m1","pages":"18–21"},{"type":"build","words":["We","paint","the door","green"],"sentence":"We paint the door green.","zh":"我们把门漆成绿色。","roles":["主语 S","谓语 V","宾语 O","宾补 C"],"why":"green 说明 the door 的结果状态，是宾补，SVOC。","pattern":"S + V + O + C","icon":"house","id":"c3-m1-q5","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m1","pages":"18–21"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The baby sleeps.","zh":"宝宝睡着了。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V","options":["S + V","S + V + O","S + V + O + O","S + V + P","S + V + O + C"],"why":"The baby 是主语，sleeps 不带直接宾语：SV。","icon":"moon","id":"c3-m2-q1","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m2","pages":"19–22"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Coco likes milk.","zh":"可可喜欢牛奶。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O","options":["S + V","S + V + O","S + V + O + O","S + V + P","S + V + O + C"],"why":"Coco 喜欢的对象是 milk，是 SVO。","icon":"cat","id":"c3-m2-q2","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m2","pages":"19–22"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Grandma gives Mia a book.","zh":"奶奶给米娅一本书。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O + O","options":["S + V","S + V + O","S + V + O + O","S + V + P","S + V + O + C"],"why":"Mia 是接收者，a book 是所给的东西，两个宾语。","icon":"book","id":"c3-m2-q3","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m2","pages":"19–22"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The sky looks blue.","zh":"天空看起来是蓝色的。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + P","options":["S + V","S + V + O","S + V + O + O","S + V + P","S + V + O + C"],"why":"blue 说明主语天空的样子，looks 是系动词，SVP。","icon":"sky","id":"c3-m2-q4","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m2","pages":"19–22"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The game makes us happy.","zh":"这个游戏让我们开心。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O + C","options":["S + V","S + V + O","S + V + O + O","S + V + P","S + V + O + C"],"why":"happy 说明宾语 us 的状态：游戏让我们开心，SVOC。","icon":"star","id":"c3-m2-q5","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m2","pages":"19–22"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia feels the soft toy.","zh":"米娅摸着柔软的玩具。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O","options":["S + V + O","S + V + P"],"why":"这里 feels 表示触摸，the soft toy 是摸的对象，所以是 SVO。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c3-m3-q1","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m3","pages":"22–24"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia feels sleepy.","zh":"米娅觉得困了。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + P","options":["S + V + O","S + V + P"],"why":"这里 feels 连接米娅与她的状态 sleepy，是 SVP。同一个动词可以有不同用法。","icon":"moon","id":"c3-m3-q2","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m3","pages":"22–24"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mum makes Mia a cake.","zh":"妈妈给米娅做一个蛋糕。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O + O","options":["S + V + O + O","S + V + O + C"],"why":"Mia 是接收者，a cake 是做出的东西。不是说米娅变成蛋糕。","icon":"cake","id":"c3-m3-q3","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m3","pages":"22–24"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mum makes Mia happy.","zh":"妈妈让米娅开心。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O + C","options":["S + V + O + O","S + V + O + C"],"why":"happy 描述 Mia 的状态，并非给 Mia 的一个东西。","icon":"fox","id":"c3-m3-q4","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m3","pages":"22–24"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"They call the puppy Max.","zh":"他们叫这只小狗马克斯。","target":"整句","answer":"S + V + O + C","options":["S + V + O + O","S + V + O + C"],"why":"Max 是小狗的名字，是对宾语的说明。名词也可以做宾补，不一定是第二个宾语。","icon":"dog","id":"c3-m3-q5","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m3","pages":"22–24"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The little bird sings softly.","zh":"小鸟轻轻地唱歌。","target":"主干","answer":"The bird sings.","options":["The bird sings.","little softly.","The bird softly."],"why":"本句 little 是可选定语，softly 是可选状语。拿掉后保留主体和动作。","icon":"bird","id":"c3-m4-q1","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m4","pages":"18–25"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia reads a red book every day.","zh":"米娅每天读一本红色的书。","target":"主干","answer":"Mia reads a book.","options":["Mia reads a book.","Mia red every day.","reads a red."],"why":"red 和 every day 是本句的可选细节，主干仍然是 SVO。","icon":"book","id":"c3-m4-q2","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m4","pages":"18–25"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The small fox is very happy.","zh":"小狐狸很开心。","target":"基本句型","answer":"S + V + P","options":["S + V + P","S + V + O","S + V + O + O"],"why":"small 描述狐狸，very 表程度；骨架 The fox is happy. 是 SVP。","icon":"fox","id":"c3-m4-q3","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m4","pages":"18–25"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Go!","zh":"走吧！","target":"省略的主语","answer":"you","options":["you","a box","happy"],"why":"祈使句通常省略主语 you，但不是没有谈论的对象。初学先认识这个特例。","icon":"train","id":"c3-m4-q4","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m4","pages":"18–25"},{"type":"build","words":["The little bird","sings","softly"],"sentence":"The little bird sings softly.","zh":"小鸟轻轻地唱歌。","roles":["主语词组","谓语动词","方式状语"],"why":"加上细节后主干仍然是 SV。The little bird 整体作主语，softly 修饰 sings。","pattern":"S + V","icon":"house","id":"c3-m4-q5","chapter":"c3","mission":"c3-m4","pages":"18–25"},{"type":"pack","noun":"apple","plural":"apples","unit":"basket","count":3,"answer":"direct|3","mode":"direct","sentence":"I packed three apples.","zh":"装进 3 个苹果。先选直接数物品，再调整数量。","why":"apple 在这里是可数名词。三个苹果说 three apples；数量为三时用复数。","icon":"apple","id":"c4-m1-q1","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m1","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pack","noun":"water","plural":"water","unit":"cup","count":2,"answer":"unit|2","mode":"unit","sentence":"I packed two cups of water.","zh":"装进 2 杯水。这里 water 指水这种物质。","why":"这里 water 是不可数用法。用 cup 作计量单位；two cups of water 中 cups 加 s，water 不加。","icon":"water","id":"c4-m1-q2","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m1","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pack","noun":"box","plural":"boxes","unit":"bag","count":2,"answer":"direct|2","mode":"direct","sentence":"I packed two boxes.","zh":"装进 2 个盒子。","why":"box 的复数是 boxes。不是 boxs。可数物品直接和数量搭配。","icon":"box","id":"c4-m1-q3","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m1","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pack","noun":"rice","plural":"rice","unit":"bowl","count":3,"answer":"unit|3","mode":"unit","sentence":"I packed three bowls of rice.","zh":"准备 3 碗米饭。rice 在这里指食物。","why":"说 three bowls of rice，数的是碗 bowls。这里不说 three rices。","icon":"bowl","id":"c4-m1-q4","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m1","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pack","noun":"bread","plural":"bread","unit":"slice","count":2,"answer":"unit|2","mode":"unit","sentence":"I packed two slices of bread.","zh":"带上 2 片面包。bread 在这里指面包这种食物。","why":"一般说 two slices of bread。slice 是一片，可以计数；这里 bread 不加 s。","icon":"bread","id":"c4-m1-q5","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m1","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Two ___ are playing.","zh":"两个孩子在玩耍。","target":"___","answer":"children","options":["children","childs","child"],"why":"child 的复数是 children，是需要认识的不规则变化。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c4-m2-q1","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m2","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I have a few ___.","zh":"我有几本书。","target":"___","answer":"books","options":["books","water","rice"],"why":"a few 后面接可数名词复数；这里是 books。水和米饭常用 a little 表示少量。","icon":"book","id":"c4-m2-q2","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m2","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"There is a little ___.","zh":"这里有少量牛奶。","target":"___","answer":"milk","options":["milk","apples","boxes"],"why":"a little 用于这里不可数的 milk；可数复数通常用 a few。","icon":"bowl","id":"c4-m2-q3","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m2","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"How ___ water do we need?","zh":"我们需要多少水？","target":"___","answer":"much","options":["much","many"],"why":"water 在这里是不可数物质，用 how much；how many 后接可数复数。","icon":"water","id":"c4-m2-q4","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m2","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I have an idea.","zh":"我有一个想法。","target":"idea","answer":"抽象名词，也可计数","options":["抽象名词，也可计数","抽象名词，所以一定不可数"],"why":"idea 是抽象概念，但可以说 an idea、two ideas。抽象不等于不可数。","icon":"star","id":"c4-m2-q5","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m2","pages":"26–28"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is here. ___ has a book.","zh":"米娅在这里。她有一本书。","target":"___","answer":"She","options":["She","Her","Hers"],"why":"这里需要主语形式 She 来代替 Mia。Her 不能在这句单独作主语。","icon":"portrait","id":"c4-m3-q1","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m3","pages":"29–33"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Coco plays with ___.","zh":"可可和她一起玩。这里“她”指米娅。","target":"___","answer":"her","options":["she","her","hers"],"why":"介词 with 后用宾格 her。这不是说可可和自己玩。","icon":"cat","id":"c4-m3-q2","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m3","pages":"29–33"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"This is ___ book.","zh":"这是我的书。","target":"___","answer":"my","options":["my","mine","me"],"why":"后面还跟着名词 book，使用 my。mine 可以单独表示“我的那本”。","icon":"book","id":"c4-m3-q3","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m3","pages":"29–33"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"This book is ___.","zh":"这本书是我的。","target":"___","answer":"mine","options":["my","mine","I"],"why":"这里没有在空格后重复 book，用 mine。它在句中作表语。","icon":"book","id":"c4-m3-q4","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m3","pages":"29–33"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia sees ___ in the mirror.","zh":"米娅在镜子里看见的是她自己。","target":"___","answer":"herself","options":["herself","myself","himself"],"why":"主语 Mia 与看到的对象是同一个人，用 herself；不是仅因名字重复就使用反身代词。","icon":"mirror","id":"c4-m3-q5","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m3","pages":"29–33"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Everyone ___ ready.","zh":"每个人都准备好了。","target":"___","answer":"is","options":["is","are"],"why":"everyone 意思涉及所有人，但在标准英语中语法上按单数配动词，所以用 is。","icon":"star","id":"c4-m3-q6","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m3","pages":"29–33"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The small rabbit sleeps.","zh":"找到完整的主语词组。","parts":["The small rabbit","sleeps"],"answer":"The small rabbit","why":"The small rabbit 整体作主语；small 只是其中的定语。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c4-m4-q1","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m4","pages":"28–34"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia likes the blue bag.","zh":"找到动词 likes 的宾语。","parts":["Mia","likes","the blue bag"],"answer":"the blue bag","why":"喜欢的是整只蓝色背包。the blue bag 整体作宾语。","icon":"bag","id":"c4-m4-q2","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m4","pages":"28–34"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Coco is our friend.","zh":"找到说明 Coco 身份的表语。","parts":["Coco","is","our friend"],"answer":"our friend","why":"our friend 说明主语 Coco 是谁，作表语，而不是宾语。","icon":"cat","id":"c4-m4-q3","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m4","pages":"28–34"},{"type":"role","sentence":"We call the rabbit Snow.","zh":"找到表示兔子名字的宾语补足语。","parts":["We","call","the rabbit","Snow"],"answer":"Snow","why":"Snow 是我们给兔子的名字，说明宾语 the rabbit，作宾补。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c4-m4-q4","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m4","pages":"28–34"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia sits with her friends.","zh":"找到介词 with 的宾语。","parts":["Mia","sits","with","her friends"],"answer":"her friends","why":"with 后面的 her friends 是介词宾语，with her friends 整体是介词短语。","icon":"portrait","id":"c4-m4-q5","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m4","pages":"28–34"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Reading books is fun.","zh":"找出整体作主语的活动。","parts":["Reading books","is","fun"],"answer":"Reading books","why":"Reading books 表示“读书这项活动”，整体作主语。","icon":"capsule","id":"c4-m5-q1","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m5","pages":"34–40"},{"type":"role","sentence":"I know what Mia wants.","zh":"找出整体作宾语的从句。","parts":["I","know","what Mia wants"],"answer":"what Mia wants","why":"what Mia wants 表示米娅想要的东西，整体作 know 的宾语。这里不是问句语序。","icon":"capsule","id":"c4-m5-q2","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m5","pages":"34–40"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I enjoy ___ stories.","zh":"我喜欢读故事。","target":"___","answer":"reading","options":["reading","to read"],"why":"enjoy 通常接动名词形式 reading。功能相近不表示所有结构都能自由互换。","icon":"book","id":"c4-m5-q3","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m5","pages":"34–40"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I want ___ a story.","zh":"我想读一个故事。","target":"___","answer":"to read","options":["reading","to read"],"why":"want 在这里接 to read。不定式的具体搭配会在第 17 章进一步学习。","icon":"book","id":"c4-m5-q4","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m5","pages":"34–40"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"After ___, Mia rests.","zh":"读完书以后，米娅休息。","target":"___","answer":"reading","options":["reading","to read"],"why":"介词 after 后可接 reading。不直接把 to read 放在这里。不是“有名词功能就任何位置都能放”。","icon":"capsule","id":"c4-m5-q5","chapter":"c4","mission":"c4-m5","pages":"34–40"},{"type":"portrait","sentence":"Find the small fox with a book.","zh":"找到拿着书的小个子狐狸。","clues":[["size","small","small · 小个子"],["prop","book","with a book · 拿着书"]],"answer":"B","characters":[{"id":"A","size":"big","color":"red","prop":"hat"},{"id":"B","size":"small","color":"red","prop":"book"},{"id":"C","size":"big","color":"blue","prop":"book"},{"id":"D","size":"small","color":"blue","prop":"hat"}],"why":"小个子先留下 B、D；拿着书再留下 B。两条定语一起确定对象。","icon":"portrait","id":"c5-m1-q1","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m1","pages":"41–45"},{"type":"portrait","sentence":"Find the big fox in blue.","zh":"找到穿蓝衣服的大个子狐狸。","clues":[["size","big","big · 大个子"],["color","blue","in blue · 穿蓝衣服"]],"answer":"C","characters":[{"id":"A","size":"big","color":"red","prop":"hat"},{"id":"B","size":"small","color":"red","prop":"book"},{"id":"C","size":"big","color":"blue","prop":"book"},{"id":"D","size":"small","color":"blue","prop":"hat"}],"why":"大个子是 A、C；穿蓝衣服的是 C、D。共同符合的是 C。","icon":"portrait","id":"c5-m1-q2","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m1","pages":"41–45"},{"type":"portrait","sentence":"Find the fox in red with a hat.","zh":"找到穿红衣服、戴帽子的狐狸。","clues":[["color","red","in red · 穿红衣服"],["prop","hat","with a hat · 戴帽子"]],"answer":"A","characters":[{"id":"A","size":"big","color":"red","prop":"hat"},{"id":"B","size":"small","color":"red","prop":"book"},{"id":"C","size":"big","color":"blue","prop":"book"},{"id":"D","size":"small","color":"blue","prop":"hat"}],"why":"红衣服留下 A、B；戴帽子再确定 A。线索修饰的是 fox。","icon":"portrait","id":"c5-m1-q3","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m1","pages":"41–45"},{"type":"portrait","sentence":"Find the small fox with a hat.","zh":"找到戴帽子的小个子狐狸。","clues":[["size","small","small · 小个子"],["prop","hat","with a hat · 戴帽子"]],"answer":"D","characters":[{"id":"A","size":"big","color":"red","prop":"hat"},{"id":"B","size":"small","color":"red","prop":"book"},{"id":"C","size":"big","color":"blue","prop":"book"},{"id":"D","size":"small","color":"blue","prop":"hat"}],"why":"小个子是 B、D；戴帽子的是 A、D，所以选 D。","icon":"portrait","id":"c5-m1-q4","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m1","pages":"41–45"},{"type":"portrait","sentence":"Find the fox in blue with a book.","zh":"找到穿蓝衣服、拿着书的狐狸。","clues":[["color","blue","in blue · 穿蓝衣服"],["prop","book","with a book · 拿着书"]],"answer":"C","characters":[{"id":"A","size":"big","color":"red","prop":"hat"},{"id":"B","size":"small","color":"red","prop":"book"},{"id":"C","size":"big","color":"blue","prop":"book"},{"id":"D","size":"small","color":"blue","prop":"hat"}],"why":"in blue 和 with a book 都接在 fox 后面添加线索。共同符合的是 C。","icon":"portrait","id":"c5-m1-q5","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m1","pages":"41–45"},{"type":"build","words":["a","red","bag"],"sentence":"a red bag.","zh":"拼出“一个红色背包”。","roles":["冠词","形容词","名词"],"why":"普通形容词 red 在这里放在名词 bag 之前。","pattern":"前置形容词","icon":"house","id":"c5-m2-q1","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m2","pages":"42–48"},{"type":"build","words":["something","new"],"sentence":"something new.","zh":"拼出“新的东西”。","roles":["不定代词","形容词"],"why":"something 等复合不定代词后面放形容词：something new。","pattern":"不定代词 + 形容词","icon":"house","id":"c5-m2-q2","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m2","pages":"42–48"},{"type":"build","words":["the fox","with a book"],"sentence":"the fox with a book.","zh":"拼出“拿着书的那只狐狸”。","roles":["名词词组","后置线索"],"why":"with a book 是介词短语，接在 fox 后面修饰它。","pattern":"名词 + 后置定语","icon":"house","id":"c5-m2-q3","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m2","pages":"42–48"},{"type":"build","words":["a lovely","small","red","bag"],"sentence":"a lovely small red bag.","zh":"用给定词块拼出“一个可爱的小红背包”。","roles":["看法","大小","颜色","名词"],"why":"这几个形容词的常见自然顺序是看法 lovely、大小 small、颜色 red，然后是 bag。","pattern":"看法 → 大小 → 颜色","icon":"house","id":"c5-m2-q4","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m2","pages":"42–48"},{"type":"build","words":["a","sleeping","cat"],"sentence":"a sleeping cat.","zh":"拼出“一只睡着的猫”。","roles":["冠词","分词作修饰语","名词"],"why":"单个分词 sleeping 可以放在名词前。较长的 sleeping under the tree 则常接在名词后。","pattern":"单个分词可以前置","icon":"house","id":"c5-m2-q5","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m2","pages":"42–48"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The bird in the tree sings.","zh":"哪一组词修饰 bird，说明是哪只鸟？","parts":["The bird","in the tree","sings"],"answer":"in the tree","why":"介词短语 in the tree 修饰 bird，作后置定语。","icon":"bird","id":"c5-m3-q1","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m3","pages":"44–48"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The fox that has a book is Mia.","zh":"哪一组词给 fox 添加“拿着书”的线索？","parts":["The fox","that has a book","is Mia"],"answer":"that has a book","why":"that has a book 是定语从句，在 fox 后面描述它。","icon":"portrait","id":"c5-m3-q2","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m3","pages":"44–48"},{"type":"role","sentence":"I need a book to read.","zh":"哪一组词修饰 book，说明是用来读的书？","parts":["I","need","a book","to read"],"answer":"to read","why":"to read 是不定式结构，放在 book 后作定语。","icon":"book","id":"c5-m3-q3","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m3","pages":"44–48"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The rabbit sitting under the tree is white.","zh":"哪一整组词修饰 rabbit？","parts":["The rabbit","sitting under the tree","is white"],"answer":"sitting under the tree","why":"sitting under the tree 是较长的分词短语，整体跟在 rabbit 后面。","icon":"rabbit","id":"c5-m3-q4","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m3","pages":"44–48"},{"type":"role","sentence":"The toy made by Mia is blue.","zh":"哪一组词说明 toy 是米娅做的？","parts":["The toy","made by Mia","is blue"],"answer":"made by Mia","why":"made by Mia 是过去分词短语，修饰 toy，表达“由米娅制作的”。","icon":"box","id":"c5-m3-q5","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m3","pages":"44–48"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The happy fox smiles.","zh":"开心的狐狸笑了。","target":"happy","answer":"定语：描述名词 fox","options":["定语：描述名词 fox","表语：接在系动词后"],"why":"happy 在名词 fox 前作定语；本句谓语是 smiles。","icon":"fox","id":"c5-m4-q1","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m4","pages":"41–48"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The fox is happy.","zh":"狐狸很开心。","target":"happy","answer":"表语：说明主语状态","options":["定语：接在 fox 前","表语：说明主语状态"],"why":"happy 通过 is 说明主语 the fox 的状态，是表语。","icon":"mirror","id":"c5-m4-q2","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m4","pages":"41–48"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I want something warm.","zh":"我想要暖和的东西。","target":"warm","answer":"放在 something 后面","options":["放在 something 前面","放在 something 后面"],"why":"warm 修饰复合不定代词 something，通常放在它后面。","icon":"bag","id":"c5-m4-q3","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m4","pages":"41–48"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The cat sleeping on the chair is white.","zh":"在椅子上睡觉的猫是白色的。","target":"sleeping on the chair","answer":"描述 cat 的后置定语","options":["描述 cat 的后置定语","整句的谓语动词"],"why":"sleeping on the chair 整体修饰 cat；is 才是本句的限定谓语动词。","icon":"cat","id":"c5-m4-q4","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m4","pages":"41–48"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia has a small red bag.","zh":"米娅有一个小红背包。","target":"red","answer":"与 small 一起描述 bag","options":["与 small 一起描述 bag","描述 small 有多小"],"why":"small 和 red 都给 bag 添加不同特征。要表达“非常小”，可用副词 very 修饰 small。","icon":"bag","id":"c5-m4-q5","chapter":"c5","mission":"c5-m4","pages":"41–48"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"I","time":"now","be":"am","tail":"happy","answer":"I|now|am","sentence":"I am happy.","zh":"描述现在的“我很开心”。","why":"I 在一般现在时里配 am：I am happy。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m1-q1","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m1","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"She","time":"now","be":"is","tail":"a painter","answer":"She|now|is","sentence":"She is a painter.","zh":"描述现在的“她是一位画家”。","why":"She 是第三人称单数，配 is。a painter 是身份表语。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m1-q2","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m1","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"They","time":"now","be":"are","tail":"ready","answer":"They|now|are","sentence":"They are ready.","zh":"描述现在的“他们准备好了”。","why":"They 表复数，配 are。ready 描述他们的状态。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m1-q3","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m1","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"You","time":"now","be":"are","tail":"kind","answer":"You|now|are","sentence":"You are kind.","zh":"描述现在的“你很友善”。you 在这里指一个人。","why":"you 无论指一人还是多人，一般现在时都配 are，不配 is。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m1-q4","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m1","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"Mia","time":"now","be":"is","tail":"here","answer":"Mia|now|is","sentence":"Mia is here.","zh":"描述现在的“米娅在这里”。","why":"单个名字 Mia 配 is；here 表示位置。be 不一定翻译成“是”。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m1-q5","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m1","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"I","time":"past","be":"was","tail":"tired","answer":"I|past|was","sentence":"I was tired.","zh":"描述昨天的“我很累”。","why":"普通过去陈述句中，I 配 was。本题不涉及虚拟语气。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m2-q1","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m2","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"She","time":"past","be":"was","tail":"happy","answer":"She|past|was","sentence":"She was happy.","zh":"描述昨天的“她很开心”。","why":"She 在普通过去陈述句里配 was。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m2-q2","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m2","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"They","time":"past","be":"were","tail":"here","answer":"They|past|were","sentence":"They were here.","zh":"描述昨天的“他们在这里”。","why":"They 在过去时里配 were。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m2-q3","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m2","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"You","time":"past","be":"were","tail":"ready","answer":"You|past|were","sentence":"You were ready.","zh":"描述昨天的“你准备好了”。you 指一个人。","why":"you 即使指一个人，过去时也配 were。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m2-q4","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m2","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"mirror","subject":"We","time":"past","be":"were","tail":"tired","answer":"We|past|were","sentence":"We were tired.","zh":"描述昨天的“我们很累”。","why":"We 配 were；时间换到过去，不能仍用 are。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m2-q5","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m2","pages":"49–50"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is happy.","zh":"米娅很开心。","target":"is","answer":"系动词，连接主体与描述","options":["系动词，连接主体与描述","助动词，与 reading 构成进行时"],"why":"这里 happy 是形容词表语，is 连接主体 Mia 与她的状态。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m3-q1","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m3","pages":"49–52"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is reading.","zh":"米娅正在读书。","target":"is","answer":"助动词，与 reading 构成进行时","options":["系动词，后面都是表语","助动词，与 reading 构成进行时"],"why":"这里 is reading 是进行结构。reading 不是本句的身份或状态表语。","icon":"book","id":"be1-m3-q2","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m3","pages":"49–52"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"They have been here before.","zh":"他们以前来过这里。","target":"been","answer":"be 的过去分词","options":["be 的过去分词","be 的一般过去时形式"],"why":"完成结构中 have 后用 been，不用 was。现在只认识形式，完整用法在时态章学习。","icon":"clock","id":"be1-m3-q3","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m3","pages":"49–52"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Please be kind.","zh":"请友善一点。","target":"be","answer":"be 的原形","options":["be 的原形","be 的过去分词"],"why":"祈使句这里使用原形 be。不是 Please is kind。","icon":"fox","id":"be1-m3-q4","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m3","pages":"49–52"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is being very patient today.","zh":"米娅今天表现得很有耐心。","target":"being","answer":"be 的 -ing 形式","options":["be 的 -ing 形式","be 的一般过去时形式"],"why":"being 是 be 的 -ing 形式。is being 在这里强调当前表现；不能把 being 当成普通过去式。","icon":"mirror","id":"be1-m3-q5","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m3","pages":"49–52"},{"type":"build","words":["She","is","not","tired"],"sentence":"She is not tired.","zh":"拼出“她不累”。","roles":["主语","be","否定词","表语"],"why":"not 接在 is 后；这里不需要 does。","pattern":"be 后加 not","icon":"house","id":"be1-m4-q1","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m4","pages":"49–52（补充入门练习）"},{"type":"build","words":["They","are","not","here"],"sentence":"They are not here.","zh":"拼出“他们不在这里”。","roles":["主语","be","否定词","位置"],"why":"They 配 are，not 接在 are 后面。","pattern":"be 后加 not","icon":"house","id":"be1-m4-q2","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m4","pages":"49–52（补充入门练习）"},{"type":"build","words":["Is","she","ready"],"sentence":"Is she ready?","zh":"拼出问句“她准备好了吗？”","roles":["be 提前","主语","表语"],"why":"一般疑问句把 is 放在主语 she 前：Is she ready?","pattern":"be 提到主语前","icon":"house","punctuation":"?","id":"be1-m4-q3","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m4","pages":"49–52（补充入门练习）"},{"type":"build","words":["Were","they","happy"],"sentence":"Were they happy?","zh":"拼出问句“他们那时开心吗？”","roles":["过去 be 提前","主语","表语"],"why":"过去问句 They were happy. 变成 Were they happy?","pattern":"过去的 be 问句","icon":"house","punctuation":"?","id":"be1-m4-q4","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m4","pages":"49–52（补充入门练习）"},{"type":"build","words":["Mia","can","be","a painter"],"sentence":"Mia can be a painter.","zh":"拼出“米娅可以成为一位画家”。","roles":["主语","情态动词","be 原形","身份"],"why":"can 后用动词原形 be，不用 is。","pattern":"can + be","icon":"house","id":"be1-m4-q5","chapter":"be1","mission":"be1-m4","pages":"49–52（补充入门练习）"},{"type":"director","frame":"The fox walks {manner}.","axes":{"manner":[["slowly","慢慢地"],["quickly","快速地"]]},"expected":{"manner":"slowly"},"answer":"{\"manner\":\"slowly\"}","sentence":"The fox walks slowly.","zh":"让狐狸慢慢地走。观察速度，再确认这句故事。","why":"slowly 表示走的方式：慢慢地。换成 quickly 时速度会加快，意思也不同。","icon":"director","id":"c6-m1-q1","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m1","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"director","frame":"The fox walks {manner} {place}.","axes":{"manner":[["slowly","慢慢地"],["quickly","快速地"]],"place":[["in the garden","在花园里"],["at home","在家里"]]},"expected":{"manner":"quickly","place":"in the garden"},"answer":"{\"manner\":\"quickly\",\"place\":\"in the garden\"}","sentence":"The fox walks quickly in the garden.","zh":"让狐狸在花园里快速地走。需要同时调节速度和地点。","why":"quickly 给动作添加方式；in the garden 给动作添加地点。两组状语各司其职。","icon":"director","id":"c6-m1-q2","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m1","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"director","frame":"The fox {frequency} walks in the garden.","axes":{"frequency":[["always","每次都"],["sometimes","有时"],["never","从不"]]},"expected":{"frequency":"sometimes"},"answer":"{\"frequency\":\"sometimes\"}","sentence":"The fox sometimes walks in the garden.","zh":"狐狸有时去花园散步。把频率调成“有时”，而不是每次或从不。","why":"sometimes 表示有时。示意轨迹不是固定百分比；它只帮助对比频率意义。","icon":"director","id":"c6-m1-q3","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m1","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"director","frame":"The fox will walk {time}.","axes":{"time":[["today","今天"],["tomorrow","明天"]]},"expected":{"time":"today"},"answer":"{\"time\":\"today\"}","sentence":"The fox will walk today.","zh":"让这个散步故事发生在今天。","why":"today 是时间副词，为将要散步这件事提供时间信息。今天也可以谈论稍后将做的事，不能见到 today 就机械选一种时态。","icon":"director","id":"c6-m1-q4","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m1","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"director","frame":"The fox is {degree} tired.","axes":{"degree":[["slightly","有一点"],["very","非常"]]},"expected":{"degree":"very"},"answer":"{\"degree\":\"very\"}","sentence":"The fox is very tired.","zh":"狐狸非常累。把程度调高，看看疲倦刻度变化。","why":"very 修饰形容词 tired，表示很累；副词也能修饰形容词，而不只修饰动作。","icon":"director","id":"c6-m1-q5","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m1","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"build","words":["Mia","often","reads"],"sentence":"Mia often reads.","zh":"拼出“米娅经常读书”。","roles":["主语","频率副词","实义动词"],"why":"often 在这个常见语序中放在 reads 前；也存在其他强调位置，不把本题当作所有语序的穷尽。","pattern":"实义动词前","icon":"house","id":"c6-m2-q1","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m2","pages":"59–62"},{"type":"build","words":["Mia","is","often","happy"],"sentence":"Mia is often happy.","zh":"拼出“米娅经常很开心”。","roles":["主语","be","频率副词","表语"],"why":"be 作主要动词时，often 常放在 is 后面。","pattern":"be 后","icon":"house","id":"c6-m2-q2","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m2","pages":"59–62"},{"type":"build","words":["Mia","reads","the book","carefully"],"sentence":"Mia reads the book carefully.","zh":"用给定词块拼出“米娅仔细地读这本书”。","roles":["主语","动词","宾语","方式状语"],"why":"在本题常见语序中，carefully 放在宾语 the book 后。不把它硬插在 reads 与 the book 之间。","pattern":"常见的句末方式状语","icon":"house","id":"c6-m2-q3","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m2","pages":"59–62"},{"type":"build","words":["The fox","walks","very","slowly"],"sentence":"The fox walks very slowly.","zh":"拼出“狐狸走得非常慢”。","roles":["主语","动词","程度副词","方式副词"],"why":"very 修饰副词 slowly，组成 very slowly。","pattern":"副词也可修饰副词","icon":"house","id":"c6-m2-q4","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m2","pages":"59–62"},{"type":"build","words":["They","are","always","ready"],"sentence":"They are always ready.","zh":"拼出“他们总是准备好了”。","roles":["主语","be","频率副词","表语"],"why":"always 在这个中性语序中放在 are 后面。","pattern":"be 后的频率副词","icon":"house","id":"c6-m2-q5","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m2","pages":"59–62"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia sings softly.","zh":"米娅轻轻地唱歌。","target":"softly","answer":"方式","options":["方式","时间","地点"],"why":"softly 回答“唱得怎样”，是方式信息。","icon":"bird","id":"c6-m3-q1","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m3","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia sometimes sings.","zh":"米娅有时唱歌。","target":"sometimes","answer":"频率","options":["频率","程度","地点"],"why":"sometimes 回答“多常发生”，不等于某一个具体时间点。","icon":"music","id":"c6-m3-q2","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m3","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia will sing tomorrow.","zh":"米娅明天会唱歌。","target":"tomorrow","answer":"时间","options":["时间","方式","程度"],"why":"tomorrow 回答“什么时候”。","icon":"clock","id":"c6-m3-q3","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m3","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia sings outside.","zh":"米娅在外面唱歌。","target":"outside","answer":"地点","options":["地点","频率","评论"],"why":"outside 回答“在哪里”。","icon":"tree","id":"c6-m3-q4","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m3","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is very happy.","zh":"米娅很开心。","target":"very","answer":"程度","options":["程度","时间","地点"],"why":"very 加强 happy 的程度；修饰的是形容词。","icon":"fox","id":"c6-m3-q5","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m3","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Luckily, Mia found her book.","zh":"幸运的是，米娅找到了书。","target":"Luckily","answer":"对整件事的评论","options":["对整件事的评论","说明找书的速度"],"why":"Luckily 表达说话者觉得这件事幸运，并不是说她以“幸运的速度”找书。","icon":"book","id":"c6-m3-q6","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m3","pages":"53–58"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia reads in the garden.","zh":"找出说明阅读地点的词组。","parts":["Mia","reads","in the garden"],"answer":"in the garden","why":"in the garden 在这句中给 reads 提供地点，作状语。","icon":"flower","id":"c6-m4-q1","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m4","pages":"64–68"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia rests because it rains.","zh":"找出说明休息原因的从句。","parts":["Mia","rests","because it rains"],"answer":"because it rains","why":"because it rains 是原因状语从句，补充休息这件事的原因。","icon":"water","id":"c6-m4-q2","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m4","pages":"64–68"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Mia reads to learn.","zh":"找出表示读书目的的词组。","parts":["Mia","reads","to learn"],"answer":"to learn","why":"to learn 是不定式，在这里表示目的，而不是作名词的定语。","icon":"book","id":"c6-m4-q3","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m4","pages":"64–68"},{"type":"role","sentence":"Smiling, Mia opens the gift.","zh":"找出说明米娅同时微笑的部分。","parts":["Smiling","Mia","opens","the gift"],"answer":"Smiling","why":"Smiling 是分词状语，微笑的人是主句主语 Mia。不能让逻辑主语不相符。","icon":"gift","id":"c6-m4-q4","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m4","pages":"64–68"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"The fox in the garden is Mia.","zh":"花园里的狐狸是米娅。","target":"in the garden","answer":"定语：帮助认出哪只狐狸","options":["定语：帮助认出哪只狐狸","状语：说明读书地点"],"why":"本句 in the garden 修饰 fox，是定语。同一个短语在其他句子中可以作状语，要看关系。","icon":"portrait","id":"c6-m4-q5","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m4","pages":"64–68"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I have already packed my bag.","zh":"我已经把背包装好了。","target":"already","answer":"到现在之前已经完成","options":["到现在之前已经完成","此刻还在继续装包"],"why":"already 表示比当前参照时间更早已完成。它本身不等于一个过去时态。","icon":"bag","id":"c6-m5-q1","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m5","pages":"62–64"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I am still packing my bag.","zh":"我仍然在装背包。","target":"still","answer":"装包还在持续","options":["装包还在持续","装包已经完成"],"why":"still 强调情况继续；本句 am packing 说明动作正在进行。","icon":"bag","id":"c6-m5-q2","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m5","pages":"62–64"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I have not packed my bag yet.","zh":"到现在，我还没把背包装好。","target":"yet","answer":"到现在还没有，通常有所期待","options":["到现在还没有，通常有所期待","保证明天一定装好"],"why":"not ... yet 说明到参照时间还没发生，并不保证某一天一定完成。","icon":"bag","id":"c6-m5-q3","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m5","pages":"62–64"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Is Mia here yet?","zh":"米娅到了吗？说话者期待她来。","target":"yet","answer":"询问期待的事情是否已发生","options":["询问期待的事情是否已发生","询问米娅是否永远不会来"],"why":"疑问句中的 yet 常用于询问期待中的变化是否已经发生。","icon":"portrait","id":"c6-m5-q4","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m5","pages":"62–64"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Mia is still happy.","zh":"米娅仍然很开心。","target":"still","answer":"开心的状态继续着","options":["开心的状态继续着","正在做一种叫 happy 的动作"],"why":"still 也能修饰持续的状态，不只搭配正在进行的动作。","icon":"mirror","id":"c6-m5-q5","chapter":"c6","mission":"c6-m5","pages":"62–64"},{"type":"time","sentence":"I water the flowers every day.","zh":"阿栗每天给花浇水。这是一个习惯。","target":"water","answer":"每天的习惯","options":["每天的习惯","此刻正在发生","过去已经发生"],"why":"这里讲反复的习惯，用一般现在时 water。不是说此刻一定正在浇水。","icon":"flower","time":"habit","id":"t1-m1-q1","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m1","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"time","sentence":"I am watering the flowers now.","zh":"看，阿栗此刻正在给花浇水。","target":"am watering","answer":"此刻正在发生","options":["每天的习惯","此刻正在发生","过去已经发生"],"why":"画面正在进行，用 am + watering。I 后面用 am。","icon":"flower","time":"now","id":"t1-m1-q2","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m1","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"time","sentence":"I watered the flowers yesterday.","zh":"相册里是昨天给花浇水的照片。","target":"watered","answer":"过去已经发生","options":["每天的习惯","此刻正在发生","过去已经发生"],"why":"明确讲昨天的事件，用一般过去时 watered。","icon":"flower","time":"past","id":"t1-m1-q3","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m1","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"time","sentence":"She reads every evening.","zh":"她每天晚上都会读书。","target":"reads","answer":"每天的习惯","options":["每天的习惯","此刻正在发生","过去已经发生"],"why":"反复的阅读习惯用一般现在时；she 后的 read 加 -s。","icon":"book","time":"habit","id":"t1-m1-q4","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m1","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"time","sentence":"She is reading now.","zh":"她此刻正在看这本书。","target":"is reading","answer":"此刻正在发生","options":["每天的习惯","此刻正在发生","过去已经发生"],"why":"此刻进行：she + is + reading。不是单独加一个 -ing 就完整了。","icon":"book","time":"now","id":"t1-m1-q5","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m1","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Every day, she ___ the flowers.","zh":"说的是她每天的习惯。","target":"___","answer":"waters","options":["waters","is watering","watered"],"why":"习惯用一般现在时。主语 she，对应 waters。","icon":"flower","id":"t1-m2-q1","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m2","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Look! She ___ the flowers.","zh":"请描述眼前正在发生的动作。","target":"___","answer":"is watering","options":["waters","is watering","watered"],"why":"这里明确描述眼前进行的动作，用 is watering。","icon":"flower","id":"t1-m2-q2","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m2","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"Yesterday, she ___ the flowers.","zh":"昨天，她给花浇了水。","target":"___","answer":"watered","options":["waters","is watering","watered"],"why":"这里讲昨天的过去事件，用 watered。","icon":"flower","id":"t1-m2-q3","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m2","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"build","words":["I","am","reading","now"],"sentence":"I am reading now.","zh":"我此刻正在读书。","roles":["主语","be 动词","动词-ing","时间"],"why":"I 后面用 am；现在进行时是 am reading，不能漏掉 am。","pattern":"现在进行时","icon":"house","id":"t1-m2-q4","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m2","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"},{"type":"pick","sentence":"I went to the park yesterday.","zh":"我昨天去了公园。","target":"went","answer":"go 的过去式","options":["go 的过去式","go 的现在进行式","go 的第三人称单数式"],"why":"went 是 go 的不规则过去式。并非所有动词的过去式都加 -ed。","icon":"tree","id":"t1-m2-q5","chapter":"t1","mission":"t1-m2","pages":"69–92（选取入门目标）"}]